      "text": "As of Friday, $4.3B of COVID era funds remained unused and mostly dormant. Thanks to the work of @SecretaryLCD and @Sonderling47 @USDOL, $1.4B was recovered and returned directly to the Treasury general account, and team is moving urgently to return the remaining $2.9B.  \n\nThis had been pointed out in a 2023 IG report, and action is now being taken. \n\nhttps://t.co/XCRqDpxUiP",
